ositioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech CSD","UX/UI","Frontend Engineering","Design Systems","Product Thinking","AI Product Development"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest positioning is not simply “UI/UX Designer” and not simply “Frontend Developer.”"},{"type":"p","text":"The differentiator should be:"},{"type":"p","text":"A product professional who can understand user problems, design the experience, build the interface, integrate the backend/AI capabilities, measure the outcome, and iterate the product."},{"type":"p","text":"For the 2026+ market, the strongest specialization is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product Design","React/TypeScript","Design Systems","AI UX","Full-Stack Product Engineering."],"sep":"+"}]}]}